/**Function*************************************************************

  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap22 mapper probe.]

  Description [stmap22 tests a moderate deep early-profile seed exception:
  before the adaptive profile opens, one-inverter middle-slack relief is
  admitted for shallow candidates as in stmap20, and for deeper candidates
  when they clear a moderate mapper-arrival improvement boundary.]

  SideEffects []

  SeeAlso     []

***********************************************************************/
