   510	  stmap14, the lower-moderate middle-slack relief must save two inverter areas
   511	  instead of one. In stmap15, one-inverter relief is restored only after the
   512	  mapper observes a high lower-moderate/middle-slack profile. In stmap16, the
   513	  same behavior also reports each admitted relief choice. In stmap17, the
   514	  adaptive one-inverter relief threshold also requires a material mapper-arrival
